From adf5f24551bc1f6b7b589ae6967b0158151a2714 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hugues Fruchet <hugues.fruchet@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 11:54:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] media: verisilicon: g1: remove NV16 support

Decoding to NV16 pixel format has been introduced when adding
JPEG decoding support in order to support MJPEG camera sending
YUV422 encoded JPEG stream.
Unfortunately this cause some regressions with other compressed
formats such as H264 or VP8 which wrongly exposes NV16 while only
NV12 is supported.
NV16 pixel format support is so skipped for now and YUV422 MJPEG
stream support will be revisited later-on.

Change-Id: I760d13d4527146aeb02b323014ebea9f5258276d
Signed-off-by: Hugues Fruchet <hugues.fruchet@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/608907
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Hugues FRUCHET <hugues.fruchet@st.com>
Domain-Review: Philippe CORNU <philippe.cornu@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Hugues FRUCHET <hugues.fruchet@st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Philippe CORNU <philippe.cornu@foss.st.com>
---
 .../media/platform/verisilicon/stm32mp25_vpu_hw.c    | 12 ------------
 1 file changed, 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/verisilicon/stm32mp25_vpu_hw.c b/drivers/media/platform/verisilicon/stm32mp25_vpu_hw.c
index a44d57c3d905..67ba07e72aa7 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/verisilicon/stm32mp25_vpu_hw.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/verisilicon/stm32mp25_vpu_hw.c
@@ -29,18 +29,6 @@ static const struct hantro_fmt stm32mp25_vdec_fmts[] = {
 			.step_height = MB_DIM,
 		},
 	},
-	{
-		.fourcc = V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV16,
-		.codec_mode = HANTRO_MODE_NONE,
-		.frmsize = {
-			.min_width = FMT_MIN_WIDTH,
-			.max_width = FMT_4K_WIDTH,
-			.step_width = MB_DIM,
-			.min_height = FMT_MIN_HEIGHT,
-			.max_height = FMT_4K_HEIGHT,
-			.step_height = MB_DIM,
-		},
-	},
 	{
 		.fourcc = V4L2_PIX_FMT_VP8_FRAME,
 		.codec_mode = HANTRO_MODE_VP8_DEC,
